# Shared Utilities

When editing shared utils or adding display helpers:

- Keep formatters pure; export from the package/app `shared/utils` barrel
- Subject/class display and enum badge colors live here — consumers must use these helpers, not one-off strings/colors
- Use `cn()` for class merging; prefer existing `formatDate` / `formatDateTime` / `formatTime` over new date helpers
- Handle null/undefined in getters; do not duplicate color maps in features
